    <string name="bat_generic">Sozlamalarda «Vector SMS» uchun batareya tejash rejimini o\'chiring: «Cheklovsiz» yoki «Optimallashtirmaslik» ni tanlang.</string>
    <string name="bat_xiaomi">Xiaomi / Redmi / POCO:\n1. Sozlamalar → Ilovalar → Vector SMS\n2. «Batareya tejash» → «Cheklovsiz»\n3. «Avtomatik ishga tushirish» ni yoqing\n4. Oxirgi ilovalar ro\'yxatida Vector SMS ni pastga torting va 🔒 qulf qo\'ying</string>
    <string name="bat_samsung">Samsung:\n1. Sozlamalar → Ilovalar → Vector SMS → Batareya\n2. «Cheklanmagan» ni tanlang\n3. Sozlamalar → Batareya → Fon cheklovlari → «Hech qachon uxlamaydigan ilovalar» ga Vector SMS ni qo\'shing</string>
    <string name="bat_huawei">Huawei / Honor:\n1. Sozlamalar → Batareya → Ilovalarni ishga tushirish\n2. Vector SMS → «Qo\'lda boshqarish»\n3. Uchala belgini yoqing: avtomatik, ikkilamchi, fonda</string>
